<title>SINGAPORE: GRP Ltd full-year net profit down 40pct.</title>
<headline>GRP Ltd full-year net profit down 40pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.51 vs  2.52</p>
<p>    Final dividend (percent)	   2.50 vs  2.50</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (cents)	 1.80 vs  3.05</p>
<p>    Fully-diluted (cents)		1.81 vs  3.02</p>
<p>    Turnover				26.49 vs 26.63</p>
<p>    Other income incl interest	 0.87 vs  0.67</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.31 vs  0.20</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation	  1.05 vs  0.79</p>
</text>
